WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
I have been chasing goddess Yanyan for three years.

2
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:04,120
Her family is very poor

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,960
I have a gambling father and a sick mother.

4
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:07,760
The whole family depends on her working part-time to support the whole family.

5
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:09,000
I want to pursue her

6
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:10,880
I spent hundreds of thousands of survival coins to give her gifts.

7
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:13,720
But she said that I used money to humiliate her, which she hated the most

8
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:15,640
It’s a rich second generation like me who bullies others.

9
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:17,270
Hundreds of thousands of survival coins

10
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:18,830
Why is this guy so rich?

11
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:20,630
Of course she didn't take anything.

12
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:23,070
Yanyan is the youth goddess in the school. She is not an old girl.

13
00:00:23,310 --> 00:00:24,510
Her light bottle broke last time

14
00:00:24,590 --> 00:00:26,150
I specially bribed her part-time job at the dessert shop

15
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:27,510
Let the store manager reward you

16
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:28,670
Give her the latest light bottle

17
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:29,910
Worth 30,000 survival coins

18
00:00:30,310 --> 00:00:31,430
Like last time

19
00:00:32,070 --> 00:00:33,830
I found out that she was kicked out by her unscrupulous landlord.

20
00:00:33,990 --> 00:00:34,990
I bought a villa

21
00:00:35,070 --> 00:00:36,390
Rent for one survival coin

22
00:00:36,590 --> 00:00:38,230
Drag her best friend to bring the news to her

23
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:39,630
And last time

24
00:00:39,790 --> 00:00:41,150
Su You forces her to treat her to a birthday treat

25
00:00:41,350 --> 00:00:42,750
She couldn't escape the money and was embarrassed by the restaurant

26
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:44,110
I secretly bought the order for her

27
00:00:44,390 --> 00:00:45,350
Let the restaurant manager tell her

28
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:46,350
Won the free bill benefit
